flowchart TD
  A["点击 emoji 或快捷回复"] --> B["im.posts.quickReply"]
  B --> C["Venus/C++ JSON stringify 或 host observation"]
  C --> D["`im_quick_reply`"]
  D --> E["Helix V1 Tick/Effect 路径"]
  E --> F["`POST /api/cses/posts/quickReply` body `{postId,emoji}`；`req_id` 只透传 `Cses-Track-Id`，actor 由服务端鉴权 session 注入"]
  F --> G["`post_update`"]
  G --> H["批量 raw DomainEvent 回调 C++"]
  H --> I["Venus owning-thread tick / MobileImSdk legacy reducer"]
  I --> J["JS/C++ 重建：emoji 聚合数量、当前 actor 选中态和线程详情一致；拒绝时恢复旧聚合"]
  E -. "Persist/HTTP/WS 失败" .-> X["raw failure event 或 SOURCE_MISSING"]
  X --> I
